HP ProLiant Gen10 Debian NAS

This repository retains its Apache License 2.0.

The initial installer, validation tooling, image metadata and workstation
dashboards were adapted from Drgr33nSenior/ArchLinuxThreadripper, whose MIT
notice is retained in third-party-licenses/ArchLinuxThreadripper-MIT.txt.
The source baseline was commit 04930cb811653f55b0fd338a1e06b7c017700d71
plus the owner-requested Debian profile. The reviewed source export identity was
cbd3a20c65d724955c838aa0ddef3253f0289fcafc5e68e60668c5d918b706e2.

The Ubuntu MicroServer tutorial is referenced for hardware background only.
No code from that project is incorporated here.

The guarded macOS USB writer and its safety fixtures were adapted from the
workstation project's infrastructure/iso/usb.sh and tests/test_iso_usb.sh.
The original MIT notice above also applies to these adapted files.

The four UnPoller Insights dashboards are adapted from unpoller/dashboards,
commit adbe342f09d0fe06b1cc152d28ab0bae5ee3d8b9. Original files and hashes are
retained under observability/unpoller; generated files bind the existing
datasource and metric namespace and adapt selected panels for this deployment.
The upstream MIT notice is retained in
third-party-licenses/UnPoller-dashboards-MIT.txt.
